WEBVTT

01:37.000 --> 01:40.500
[Episode 16]

01:47.700 --> 01:49.019
Thank you for saving me.

01:49.019 --> 01:51.380
It was nothing.

01:51.380 --> 01:53.740
This is Bai Yu Tang.

01:53.740 --> 01:55.500
He held off the pursuers tonight.

01:55.500 --> 01:58.510
That's how I got you out.

02:19.820 --> 02:20.979
Zhao Hui.

02:20.979 --> 02:23.419
I saw Yue Hua tonight.

02:23.419 --> 02:25.580
Is she all right?

02:25.580 --> 02:27.820
She's fine.

02:27.820 --> 02:29.940
She's now working under Granny Hanshui

02:29.940 --> 02:31.540
as the Moon Envoy.

02:31.540 --> 02:33.500
The orthodox sects in the martial world

02:33.500 --> 02:35.140
have always regarded Hanshui Palace

02:35.140 --> 02:37.059
as a heretic cult.

02:37.059 --> 02:39.485
How could Yue Hua...

02:42.179 --> 02:45.539
Let her be. As long as she's safe.

02:45.539 --> 02:46.620
Brother Zhan.

02:46.620 --> 02:48.420
She didn't come back with you this time.

02:48.420 --> 02:51.975
Does she still insist on killing Jing Yi Ming?

02:54.580 --> 02:57.459
Jing Yi Ming might not suspect me.

02:57.459 --> 02:59.099
I want to go back to his house

02:59.099 --> 03:01.060
to see if Mrs. Jing is safe.

03:01.060 --> 03:02.060
Also,

03:02.060 --> 03:05.099
if Yue Hua really wants to
seek revenge at Jing's house,

03:05.099 --> 03:08.175
I need to be inside to support her.

03:12.379 --> 03:13.940
Be careful.

03:13.940 --> 03:15.819
Don't worry.

03:16.819 --> 03:20.177
I'll take my leave then.

03:24.739 --> 03:26.780
Young Master. Brother Ding.

03:26.780 --> 03:28.580
Young Master.

03:29.580 --> 03:31.660
Young Master, I finally get to see you again.

03:31.660 --> 03:33.380
So the men Prince Hui sent...

03:33.380 --> 03:34.670
It was the two of you.

03:34.670 --> 03:36.699
Yes, the moment we got your letter,

03:36.699 --> 03:37.979
we rode out.

03:37.979 --> 03:40.619
Didn't want to miss the show.

03:40.619 --> 03:42.059
So you saw Sister Huo.

03:42.059 --> 03:44.779
Yes, she was too slow.

03:44.779 --> 03:46.499
So we hurried here.

03:46.499 --> 03:48.140
You came at the right time.

03:48.140 --> 03:50.819
You two will be part of tomorrow's big show.

03:50.819 --> 03:53.565
Let's go. I'll pour you some water.

03:54.140 --> 03:55.420
How good your horse riding is?

03:55.420 --> 03:57.020
Is it worse than Zhu Zi?

03:57.020 --> 03:59.700
It's quite good. No need to teach me.

03:59.700 --> 04:02.779
- Zhu Zi? Who's Zhu Zi?
- Who else can it be besides you?

04:02.779 --> 04:06.339
Tomorrow, you must show me
how's your horse riding.

04:06.339 --> 04:09.779
- Of course better than Ming Zhu.
- I'm not too bad now.

04:09.779 --> 04:11.779
I feel Mouse Bai is a good man.

04:11.779 --> 04:13.659
It's not like what you said.

04:13.659 --> 04:16.504
Time will tell.

04:17.260 --> 04:19.379
Yu Lian.

04:19.379 --> 04:21.051
There's something

04:21.051 --> 04:23.320
I want to give you.

04:50.700 --> 04:53.819
I failed to protect Brother Fan.

04:53.819 --> 04:56.580
Don't say that, Lord Zhan.

04:57.580 --> 04:59.499
I know.

04:59.499 --> 05:01.200
For my brother's sake,

05:01.200 --> 05:03.629
you've exhausted yourself.

05:04.260 --> 05:05.779
My brother's death

05:05.779 --> 05:07.940
is not your fault.

05:07.940 --> 05:10.420
It's...

05:10.420 --> 05:13.410
It's those villains' fault.

05:19.860 --> 05:22.539
In court,

05:22.539 --> 05:23.939
for my brother

05:23.939 --> 05:27.659
and the girls in the Zhongxiao Pavilion,

05:27.659 --> 05:30.659
I'll testify against Jing Yi Ming.

05:30.659 --> 05:32.020
This way,

05:32.020 --> 05:35.445
my brother can rest in peace.

06:01.260 --> 06:02.820
Uncle Jing.

06:02.820 --> 06:04.060
You came to me this late.

06:04.060 --> 06:06.196
Is something the matter?

06:06.820 --> 06:08.739
It's nothing.

06:08.739 --> 06:10.859
There's a lot going on lately.

06:10.859 --> 06:13.299
I finally have some free time.

06:13.299 --> 06:15.099
I want to catch up with you.

06:15.099 --> 06:17.680
Have a seat, my nephew.

06:22.940 --> 06:24.020
Have some tea.

06:24.020 --> 06:26.080
Okay.

06:28.820 --> 06:32.739
Uncle, when I got here, I saw a mess.

06:32.739 --> 06:35.419
Mrs. Jing's maid was crying in the corridor.

06:35.419 --> 06:38.494
Did something happen?

06:39.659 --> 06:41.299
My nephew,

06:41.299 --> 06:44.460
you're concerned about your aunt's safety.

06:44.460 --> 06:47.659
Don't worry. I didn't kill her.

06:47.659 --> 06:48.979
It's not enough

06:48.979 --> 06:51.299
to atone for her mistake with death.

06:51.299 --> 06:53.099
I punish her

06:53.099 --> 06:54.419
to spend the rest of her life

06:54.419 --> 06:57.219
reflecting on herself for the rest of her life.

06:57.219 --> 06:59.827
What do you think?

07:02.260 --> 07:06.511
Her fate is your doing.

07:18.339 --> 07:21.140
Uncle, you even took out the Zhanlu Sword,

07:21.140 --> 07:24.979
so you're determined to catch up with me.

07:24.979 --> 07:26.500
I have to ask.

07:26.500 --> 07:30.140
Why did you attack my father back then?

07:30.140 --> 07:32.779
I'm sworn to Lord of Xiangyang

07:32.779 --> 07:34.419
because I want to use his influence

07:34.419 --> 07:37.580
to achieve my ambition
of ruling the martial world.

07:37.580 --> 07:38.859
Men like your father.

07:38.859 --> 07:40.219
Proud of their noble birth,

07:40.219 --> 07:41.779
their spotless virtue.

07:41.779 --> 07:44.219
They're nothing but stones in my path.

07:44.219 --> 07:46.659
I have to get rid of them one by one.

07:46.659 --> 07:49.299
I didn't kill Ding Zhen Xiong until last year.

07:49.299 --> 07:51.891
That's longer than most deserved.

07:52.500 --> 07:54.859
Considering our old friendship,

07:54.859 --> 07:56.060
before I killed him,

07:56.060 --> 07:58.500
I had a heart-to-heart talk with him.

07:58.500 --> 08:01.620
As long as he taught me Heavenward Crane Strike
and submitted to me,

08:01.620 --> 08:03.859
I would spare his life.

08:03.859 --> 08:05.600
But he yelled at me.

08:05.600 --> 08:08.460
He said I was daydreaming.

08:08.460 --> 08:11.260
I had no choice but to kill him.

08:11.260 --> 08:16.820
By the way, Ding's Heavenward Crane Strike
lives up to its name in the martial world.

08:16.820 --> 08:20.460
My suicidal warriors
surrounded your father for six hours.

08:20.460 --> 08:23.539
But no one was able to counter his moves.

08:23.539 --> 08:24.940
In the end,

08:24.940 --> 08:26.859
he used up all his energy

08:26.859 --> 08:29.179
and was killed by me.

08:29.179 --> 08:30.500
My nephew,

08:30.500 --> 08:33.380
if you want revenge,
don't pick the wrong person.

08:33.380 --> 08:34.620
Your Ding family

08:34.620 --> 08:36.339
came to this because of your father.

08:36.339 --> 08:40.700
His stubbornness. His blindness.

09:23.859 --> 09:26.219
As fast as lightning. As sharp as frost.

09:26.219 --> 09:29.940
The Zhanlu Sword. Truly worthy of its legend.

09:29.940 --> 09:32.779
From the day it was forged, the Zhanlu Sword

09:32.779 --> 09:37.064
has been meant to protect the true path.

09:38.299 --> 09:40.460
Villains like you

09:40.460 --> 09:42.099
don't deserve to use it.

09:42.099 --> 09:44.540
Your family heirloom

09:44.540 --> 09:47.339
is in the hands of your enemy.

09:47.339 --> 09:50.525
What can you do to me?

10:18.140 --> 10:19.819
Father.

10:19.819 --> 10:21.140
What should we do?

10:21.140 --> 10:24.419
He has repeatedly stirred up
trouble right under my nose.

10:24.419 --> 10:26.659
One sword stroke is too quick. Too clean.

10:26.659 --> 10:29.939
That wouldn't satisfy me.

10:30.939 --> 10:32.539
Don't worry.

10:32.539 --> 10:35.006
Leave it to me.

10:50.179 --> 10:52.380
When did you learn Heavenward Crane Strike?

10:52.380 --> 10:54.659
A third of your father's power? Perhaps less.

10:54.659 --> 10:56.020
And still you try that move?

10:56.020 --> 10:58.759
You're really overestimating yourself.

10:59.419 --> 11:03.980
I can hurt you with that 30 percent of power.

11:03.980 --> 11:05.220
Jing Yi Ming.

11:05.220 --> 11:09.100
I stabbed where your meridians converge.

11:09.100 --> 11:10.913
Now, your Great Compassion Palm?

11:10.913 --> 11:15.336
Even 30 percent of your power.
I doubt you have that much left.

11:18.140 --> 11:20.059
Take him away.

11:20.059 --> 11:21.260
Watch him closely.

11:21.260 --> 11:23.934
Don't let him die.

11:27.740 --> 11:28.860
Father.

11:28.860 --> 11:31.060
Your injuries...

11:31.060 --> 11:33.779
It's fine. Let's get down to business.

11:33.779 --> 11:37.260
Checked.
All the girls and suicidal warriors are there.

11:37.260 --> 11:40.179
I've informed Shao Ji Zu too.

11:40.179 --> 11:42.260
The Zhongxiao Pavilion is not ours.

11:42.260 --> 11:43.620
We've already done enough

11:43.620 --> 11:45.179
to lead the charge.

11:45.179 --> 11:46.779
The most important thing now

11:46.779 --> 11:49.179
is to let Shao Ji Zu buy us some time.

11:49.179 --> 11:52.492
Make sure the Jing family can escape safely.

11:53.100 --> 11:54.220
Understood.

11:54.220 --> 11:55.500
You have to do your best

11:55.500 --> 11:58.380
to clean up the mess at the Zhongxiao Pavilion.

11:58.380 --> 12:00.579
You're my only son.

12:00.579 --> 12:04.740
You'll be the successor of Shangqing Sect.

12:04.740 --> 12:07.855
You're the only one I can rely on.

12:24.440 --> 12:25.900
Convey my orders.

12:25.900 --> 12:28.340
Of Xiangyang's four gates,

12:28.340 --> 12:30.220
only the east gate remains open.

12:30.220 --> 12:31.779
Arrange 20 elite soldiers.

12:31.779 --> 12:34.100
Search everyone coming and going,
especially the women.

12:34.100 --> 12:35.699
The other three gates

12:35.699 --> 12:37.179
are to be held by elite soldiers.

12:37.179 --> 12:40.725
Set up checkpoints between the gates.
No broken messages.

12:40.725 --> 12:42.299
We stay close enough to strike as one.

12:42.299 --> 12:44.539
Remember.

12:44.539 --> 12:46.500
They're cunning.

12:46.500 --> 12:49.220
They might split up and escape.

12:49.220 --> 12:51.100
No matter what happens,

12:51.100 --> 12:54.179
those three city gates must not be opened.

12:54.179 --> 12:56.860
The east city gates must also be prepared
to be closed at any time.

12:56.860 --> 12:58.520
I understand.

12:58.520 --> 13:01.260
How goes the task I set for you?

13:01.260 --> 13:02.340
Don't worry.

13:02.340 --> 13:04.299
I've already distributed the portrait.

13:04.299 --> 13:07.380
No one will dare to take in
Zhan Zhao and his men.

13:07.380 --> 13:10.299
Violators will be treated as fugitives.

13:10.299 --> 13:11.900
Scatter their portraits

13:11.900 --> 13:15.063
to the outskirts of the city.

13:24.779 --> 13:26.459
Check them thoroughly.

13:26.459 --> 13:27.819
Especially the women.

13:27.819 --> 13:31.100
If anyone seems suspicious, let none escape.

13:31.100 --> 13:32.659
Is the source reliable?

13:32.659 --> 13:34.620
I've confirmed it. It's them.

13:34.620 --> 13:36.340
That's closest to the west gate.

13:36.340 --> 13:39.008
- Reinforce the guard.
- Yes.

14:11.659 --> 14:13.140
Zhan Zhao.

14:13.140 --> 14:18.179
Are you planning to stay
in all the shabby houses in Xiangyang?

14:18.179 --> 14:19.500
Where's Ling Long?

14:19.500 --> 14:21.140
Tell her to come out.

14:21.140 --> 14:24.140
Swords are blind. I'm afraid she'll be hurt.

14:25.140 --> 14:27.419
Commander Shao, this show of force

14:27.419 --> 14:30.739
tells me you're ready for blood.

14:30.739 --> 14:32.859
So why pretend you're here

14:32.859 --> 14:34.819
to protect Ling Long?

14:34.819 --> 14:37.219
I'll give you one last chance.

14:37.219 --> 14:39.660
Hand Ling Long and Fan Yu Lian over.

14:39.660 --> 14:41.699
I'll spare your life.

14:41.699 --> 14:44.940
Which law did she break
that you want to arrest her?

14:44.940 --> 14:46.360
Do you have any official documents?

14:46.360 --> 14:49.459
Adultery, murder, and theft. Take your pick.

14:49.459 --> 14:51.619
I'll send you the documents later.

14:51.619 --> 14:52.859
But today,

14:52.859 --> 14:54.819
I have to take her with me.

14:54.819 --> 14:57.300
I'm afraid you can't.

15:18.140 --> 15:20.449
Shoot!

15:50.020 --> 15:51.339
How did you get in here?

15:51.339 --> 15:53.746
It's safe inside.

16:44.060 --> 16:45.459
- Someone inside?
- Commander Shao.

16:45.459 --> 16:46.780
There is indeed a girl inside.

16:46.780 --> 16:48.691
But Zhan Zhao and Bai Yu Tang stand before her.

16:48.691 --> 16:50.540
Just one? Is it Ling Long?

16:50.540 --> 16:52.099
I couldn't see clearly.

16:52.099 --> 16:53.499
Covered by a curtain.

16:53.499 --> 16:55.699
All I could see was a skirt.

16:55.699 --> 16:57.380
We are sure people's inside.

16:57.380 --> 17:00.320
Why don't we send the guards here?

17:01.699 --> 17:03.699
Keep guarding back there.

17:03.699 --> 17:06.386
Yes. Let's go.

17:16.699 --> 17:18.220
Something's wrong, master.

17:18.220 --> 17:21.100
Zhan Zhao are blowing up the south gate,
trying to force their way out.

17:21.100 --> 17:22.419
What?

17:22.419 --> 17:24.340
You said that sound was explosives?

17:24.340 --> 17:26.140
That loud. How can it be fake?

17:26.140 --> 17:28.380
My brother's arm was almost blown off.

17:28.380 --> 17:31.699
If this goes on, we'll lose the south gate.

17:31.699 --> 17:34.539
But Commander Shao said not to leave our posts.

17:34.539 --> 17:36.260
Hurry up.

17:36.260 --> 17:37.779
If Commander Shao finds out

17:37.779 --> 17:39.900
I called for help, and no one came.

17:39.900 --> 17:44.342
And they got away because of it...
Shao will have our heads.

17:49.659 --> 17:51.779
You guys, maintain order in the east district.

17:51.779 --> 17:52.965
The rest, come with me.

17:52.965 --> 17:54.140
- Yes.
- My lord.

17:54.140 --> 17:57.353
If you capture Zhan Zhao,
remember to give me credit for it.

17:58.059 --> 17:59.819
- Hurry.
- Hurry.

17:59.819 --> 18:02.020
- Hurry.
- Follow me.

18:02.020 --> 18:03.340
Inform Commander Shao.

18:03.340 --> 18:05.419
- This must be credited to east gate guards.
- Yes.

18:05.419 --> 18:08.003
Let's go.

18:33.299 --> 18:36.132
Yu Lian, come with me.

19:07.533 --> 19:09.739
You call yourself Commander Shao?

19:09.739 --> 19:11.939
More like a villain.

19:11.939 --> 19:13.380
You're not just a villain.

19:13.380 --> 19:15.419
You're not carrying a head on your shoulders.

19:15.419 --> 19:18.179
Think about it.
It wasn't easy for us to save her.

19:18.179 --> 19:21.100
Why would we leave her here for you to capture?

19:21.100 --> 19:22.259
Do you think

19:22.259 --> 19:24.060
we'll let our gate guards down

19:24.060 --> 19:27.289
just because we're fighting here?

19:41.939 --> 19:43.459
Commander Shao.

19:43.459 --> 19:45.419
Commander Shao.

19:46.419 --> 19:48.419
There was an explosion at the south gate.

19:48.419 --> 19:52.193
East gate guards have been informed
and are on their way to help.

19:54.659 --> 19:55.780
Did I say it or not?

19:55.780 --> 19:59.620
No guard is to move. No matter what happens.

19:59.620 --> 20:00.884
Send men to the south gate!

20:00.884 --> 20:01.885
Feng Shao, come with me!

20:01.885 --> 20:02.917
- Yes.
- Yes, sir.

20:02.917 --> 20:05.403
You, come with me.

20:15.620 --> 20:17.380
Commander Shao, should we keep after them?

20:17.380 --> 20:20.939
Zhan Zhao played us from the start.
And you want more shame?

20:20.939 --> 20:22.593
Go back to the city.

20:25.259 --> 20:26.620
In today's pursuit of Fan Yu Lian,

20:26.620 --> 20:28.780
He Bo never even showed his face.

20:28.780 --> 20:30.860
And yet I was made to be his pawn. His tool.

20:30.860 --> 20:33.300
Risking my life for him.
What does he think I am?

20:33.300 --> 20:36.960
I'm working for His Lordship, not him.

20:56.960 --> 20:58.939
[The account book of Zhongxiao Pavilion]

20:58.939 --> 21:00.233
This is

21:00.233 --> 21:01.640
from him.

21:01.640 --> 21:05.320
It's the account book of Zhongxiao Pavilion
for this month.

21:07.300 --> 21:11.179
Isn't this to remind us that
Zhongxiao Pavilion is not just his property?

21:11.179 --> 21:13.540
He's forcing us to clean up after him.

21:13.540 --> 21:16.540
He also brought a list of all the girls

21:16.540 --> 21:20.951
and guards at Zhongxiao Pavilion.

21:26.540 --> 21:28.780
At this hour...

21:28.780 --> 21:31.220
What's he after?

21:33.620 --> 21:35.820
He Bo serves His Lordship

21:35.820 --> 21:39.100
for the power it brings him. Nothing more.

21:39.100 --> 21:41.499
There's little loyalty in it.

21:41.499 --> 21:44.699
Now, his dream has been shattered.

21:44.699 --> 21:46.300
A man like him

21:46.300 --> 21:50.539
won't sit easy with our secret.

21:50.539 --> 21:54.259
We have to help him.

21:54.259 --> 21:56.120
It's not good for my men

21:56.120 --> 21:57.940
to deal with such dirty work.

21:57.940 --> 21:59.620
Don't worry.

21:59.620 --> 22:03.381
We've prepared everything for you.

22:08.419 --> 22:09.772
Hero Zhu Zi

22:09.772 --> 22:10.920
is back!

22:10.920 --> 22:13.939
Brother Zhan, you're finally back.

22:13.939 --> 22:17.554
Lord Zhan, Brother Bai,
your efforts will not be forgotten.

22:18.580 --> 22:20.499
What kind of hero wears that?

22:20.499 --> 22:23.220
That's a girl's outfit.

22:25.939 --> 22:29.586
Why did you pick this place to meet up?

22:33.740 --> 22:35.419
This is...

22:35.419 --> 22:38.003
Yicheng magistrate.

22:41.659 --> 22:43.380
Lord Zhan! Lord Zhan, help me!

22:43.380 --> 22:45.900
Lord Zhan! Lord Zhan!

22:45.900 --> 22:48.259
- What's going on?
- Lord Zhan!

22:48.259 --> 22:49.259
I'm not sure.

22:49.259 --> 22:51.705
Mouse Bai may have a grudge against him.

22:51.705 --> 22:55.365
Lord Zhan, help! Lord Zhan, help! Help me!

22:55.365 --> 22:56.640
He knows the most about this case.

22:56.640 --> 22:59.365
We have to take him with us.

23:09.060 --> 23:12.180
Give a full account of Yu Lian's case,

23:12.180 --> 23:15.855
then we'll settle things between us.

23:25.300 --> 23:28.739
It looks like he was really scared.

23:28.739 --> 23:30.480
He'd been through a lot

23:30.480 --> 23:32.932
these days.

23:40.100 --> 23:42.219
No.

23:43.219 --> 23:44.300
Lord Zhan.

23:44.300 --> 23:46.100
No one can stay here.

23:46.100 --> 23:47.979
It's said that this place is haunted.

23:47.979 --> 23:49.459
No one will come here.

23:49.459 --> 23:50.939
You'll be safest

23:50.939 --> 23:52.900
if you stay here.

23:52.900 --> 23:54.580
Haunted?

23:54.580 --> 23:56.111
You dare to kill people,

23:56.111 --> 23:58.885
but you are afraid of ghosts?

24:02.419 --> 24:04.419
These foods are enough to last you for days.

24:04.419 --> 24:06.773
There's water. You won't get thirsty.

24:06.773 --> 24:08.340
But if you want to escape,

24:08.340 --> 24:10.659
and run into people from Zhongxiao Pavilion,

24:10.659 --> 24:14.415
they have thousands of ways
to torture you to death.

24:15.140 --> 24:16.900
When I left Yicheng,

24:16.900 --> 24:18.620
I was in a hurry.

24:18.620 --> 24:21.938
I could only bury Liu's body here.

24:21.938 --> 24:23.099
These few days,

24:23.099 --> 24:24.620
I want you to think about it.

24:24.620 --> 24:25.980
During your term,

24:25.980 --> 24:27.940
how many wrong cases have you solved?

24:27.940 --> 24:30.620
How many lives have you killed?

24:30.620 --> 24:33.180
So that when Liu comes to find you,

24:33.180 --> 24:36.125
you don't know where to start.

24:48.499 --> 24:51.660
Is Liu Hong Yi's body really here?

24:52.660 --> 24:54.539
I saw that he believes in superstitions.

24:54.539 --> 24:56.420
So I scared him on purpose.

24:56.420 --> 24:58.579
We risk our lives

24:58.579 --> 25:00.800
while he sits here, warm and safe.

25:00.800 --> 25:03.400
That's not how this should be.

25:05.900 --> 25:08.237
Why are you looking at me?

25:09.299 --> 25:11.259
You don't look like someone
who ever throws a punch.

25:11.259 --> 25:12.787
But your methods...

25:12.787 --> 25:15.820
they hit harder than my fist ever could.

25:24.220 --> 25:25.661
Tell me

25:25.661 --> 25:28.019
about you and Yicheng magistrate.

25:29.019 --> 25:30.739
It's getting late.

25:30.739 --> 25:33.918
I'll get the carriage ready and send them off.

25:43.940 --> 25:46.700
Your Sister Huo will be here soon.

25:46.700 --> 25:47.780
Take the shortcut.

25:47.780 --> 25:50.260
You can meet up with them
once you cross that mountain.

25:50.260 --> 25:52.263
Lord, aren't you coming with us?

25:52.263 --> 25:55.760
You guys go ahead. Bai and I will hold the rear
in case the pursuers come.

25:55.760 --> 25:58.284
Fine. It's always my turn.

25:58.284 --> 25:59.405
Let's switch then.

25:59.405 --> 26:01.014
I want to spend more time with my young master.

26:01.014 --> 26:02.649
Just go, Hero Zhu Zi.

26:02.649 --> 26:04.092
Take your "gunpowder" with you.

26:04.092 --> 26:06.821
Protect Yu Lian well.

26:08.579 --> 26:10.259
Go.

26:10.259 --> 26:12.939
- Be careful.
- Okay, bye then.

26:12.939 --> 26:15.177
Bye.

26:42.900 --> 26:44.825
I've counted the heads.

26:44.825 --> 26:47.535
Send all of them out of the city.

26:48.300 --> 26:49.899
One missing.

26:49.899 --> 26:52.535
You pay.

27:21.780 --> 27:23.580
I want to rescue Yu Lian

27:23.580 --> 27:25.100
and the girls from Zhongxiao Pavilion.

27:25.100 --> 27:26.340
I wonder

27:26.340 --> 27:28.260
if you could introduce me, Moon Envoy,

27:28.260 --> 27:30.300
to meet Granny Hanshui.

27:30.300 --> 27:32.020
Granny will not help you.

27:32.020 --> 27:35.380
Even if there is only a glimmer of hope,

27:35.380 --> 27:37.660
I must give it my best shot.

27:37.660 --> 27:39.059
You're an outsider.

27:39.059 --> 27:41.499
Even if you try to reason with her,

27:41.499 --> 27:43.340
you won't be able to persuade Granny.

27:43.340 --> 27:44.800
Only someone she trusts,

27:44.800 --> 27:46.340
laying out the costs and gains,

27:46.340 --> 27:48.481
could ever persuade her.

27:48.481 --> 27:50.140
[Hanshui Palace]

27:50.140 --> 27:51.699
Shut up.

27:51.699 --> 27:54.380
Zhan Zhao is covered in filth himself.

27:54.380 --> 27:55.940
How could you believe him?

27:55.940 --> 27:57.979
I think he's just lying

27:57.979 --> 28:00.979
to make Hanshui Palace work for him.

28:00.979 --> 28:03.620
Moon Envoy, you're too naive.

28:03.620 --> 28:04.900
I believe Zhan Zhao.

28:04.900 --> 28:06.420
He can defeat He Bo

28:06.420 --> 28:07.699
and lead Hanshui Palace out of this.

28:07.699 --> 28:09.380
You've only met him a few times,

28:09.380 --> 28:12.176
and you're already bewitched by him.

28:14.140 --> 28:16.059
Since I was little,

28:16.699 --> 28:20.092
Zhan Zhao has never lied to me about anything.

28:26.019 --> 28:27.739
Granny.

28:27.739 --> 28:30.059
I lied to you when I joined the sect.

28:30.059 --> 28:32.420
My real name is Ding Yue Hua.

28:32.420 --> 28:34.219
I'm the daughter of the Ding family.

28:34.219 --> 28:36.100
The Zhan family and we are old friends.

28:36.100 --> 28:37.420
Zhan Zhao, my brothers, and I

28:37.420 --> 28:38.580
grew up together.

28:38.580 --> 28:39.900
My brother, Ding Zhao Hui,

28:39.900 --> 28:41.739
is helping Zhan Zhao with his investigation.

28:41.739 --> 28:43.259
One is my biological brother.

28:43.259 --> 28:45.699
The other is my godbrother.

28:45.699 --> 28:47.842
They won't lie to me.

28:48.580 --> 28:50.820
I know I lied to you, Granny.

28:50.820 --> 28:52.979
I hid my identity and entered Hanshui Palace.

28:52.979 --> 28:54.540
I deserve to die.

28:54.540 --> 28:56.900
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

28:56.900 --> 28:58.860
Today, I risk my life to confess to you.

28:58.860 --> 29:00.140
It's because I know that you don't like

29:00.140 --> 29:02.499
the brothel business at Zhongxiao Pavilion.

29:02.499 --> 29:04.180
I hope you can think about it carefully.

29:04.180 --> 29:06.140
Why don't you take this opportunity
to work with Zhan Zhao

29:06.140 --> 29:08.492
and destroy He Bo?

29:30.860 --> 29:32.939
Moon Envoy.

29:32.939 --> 29:35.140
I can help Zhan Zhao.

29:35.140 --> 29:36.499
But on one condition.

29:36.499 --> 29:37.820
After it's done,

29:37.820 --> 29:40.979
you must bring Chang Hong Bi back to me.

29:40.979 --> 29:43.179
Otherwise,

29:43.179 --> 29:45.580
I'll punish you

29:45.580 --> 29:48.179
for all your crimes.

29:49.179 --> 29:51.553
As you command.

30:42.739 --> 30:44.860
- Master Zhi.
- Hand out the tools.

30:44.860 --> 30:46.462
Yes.

30:47.059 --> 30:49.362
Come with me.

30:53.140 --> 30:54.459
What do you mean?

30:54.459 --> 30:56.914
Just do as I say.

30:59.620 --> 31:01.781
Let's go.

31:24.940 --> 31:26.938
Hurry up.

31:28.340 --> 31:30.072
Go!

31:39.860 --> 31:41.860
Dig.

31:42.820 --> 31:44.900
What are you waiting for?

31:44.900 --> 31:46.891
Dig!

31:47.539 --> 31:50.108
Hurry up and dig.

32:14.820 --> 32:15.979
Zhi Hua.

32:15.979 --> 32:19.986
The pit you dug is perfect for burying you.

32:19.986 --> 32:22.860
Moon Envoy, you conspired with them?

32:22.860 --> 32:25.983
Aren't you afraid Chang Hong Bi...

33:07.180 --> 33:09.340
Commander Shao.

33:09.340 --> 33:12.949
Hurry, kill them.

33:28.900 --> 33:31.059
Shao Ji Zu.

33:31.059 --> 33:33.566
What are you doing?

33:34.180 --> 33:36.820
Zhi Hua. Can't you see?

33:36.820 --> 33:38.660
They're cutting off their tails to survive.

33:38.660 --> 33:41.059
You want to silence
the girls in Zhongxiao Pavilion.

33:41.059 --> 33:42.140
But you don't know that

33:42.140 --> 33:44.699
you weren't the hunter. You were the prey.

33:44.699 --> 33:46.388
Their dog-eat-dog show

33:46.388 --> 33:47.780
is truly spectacular.

33:47.780 --> 33:49.659
Today,

33:49.659 --> 33:52.179
none of you can walk out of here alive.

33:52.179 --> 33:54.295
Kill them.

34:58.459 --> 34:59.900
Shao Ji Zu.

34:59.900 --> 35:01.580
How dare you kill me?

35:01.580 --> 35:05.220
He Bo won't forgive you.

35:10.739 --> 35:13.019
He tried to kill you time and time again.

35:13.019 --> 35:14.019
Why are you still protecting him?

35:14.019 --> 35:15.580
I'm not protecting him.

35:15.580 --> 35:17.860
I'm protecting the clues.

35:17.860 --> 35:20.939
All right, then let me test

35:20.939 --> 35:24.353
your martial arts skills, the Southern Knight.

35:34.459 --> 35:38.105
Be careful. He's going to use his dagger.

35:43.300 --> 35:44.300
Bai Yu Tang.

35:44.300 --> 35:45.400
Are you done watching?

35:45.400 --> 35:47.520
He's gone.

35:50.260 --> 35:53.661
Where's Zhi Hua? Zhi Hua, wait for me!

36:15.139 --> 36:16.820
So you came.

36:16.820 --> 36:19.401
I've been waiting for you.

36:55.139 --> 36:57.620
How's my Bai Yu Palm?

36:57.620 --> 36:58.740
What a pity.

36:58.740 --> 37:02.279
From now on, you can't use
your Great Compassion Palm anymore.

37:40.979 --> 37:43.403
There are too many of them.

37:44.780 --> 37:46.750
Hang in there for a while.

38:40.939 --> 38:42.579
Huo Ling Long.

38:42.579 --> 38:44.019
Are you crazy?

38:44.019 --> 38:45.139
Shao Ji Zu.

38:45.139 --> 38:48.134
Tell your men to stop immediately.

39:55.260 --> 39:57.000
[Guanghua Army]
We have been ordered to take over

39:57.000 --> 39:58.820
the witness
in the Xiangyang Zhongxiao Pavilion case.

39:58.820 --> 40:01.099
Everyone, stop immediately.

40:01.099 --> 40:03.300
This is the jurisdiction of Xiangzhou court.

40:03.300 --> 40:05.380
Who are you to cross the line?

40:05.380 --> 40:07.180
Under the secret order of the imperial court,

40:07.180 --> 40:09.340
to assist Kaifeng Court in the investigation.

40:09.340 --> 40:10.579
What a joke.

40:10.579 --> 40:14.180
How can you investigate a case
without going through the prefecture court?

40:15.180 --> 40:17.300
This is a decree from Prince Hui.

40:17.300 --> 40:18.539
Lord Zhan and his men

40:18.539 --> 40:21.660
were ordered to secretly investigate
the Zhongxiao Pavilion case in Xiangzhou.

40:21.660 --> 40:23.905
Who dares to disobey it?

40:24.820 --> 40:25.979
Commander Shao.

40:25.979 --> 40:27.539
Have you thought it through?

40:27.539 --> 40:29.459
Are you really going against Prince Hui?

40:29.459 --> 40:30.459
You.

40:30.459 --> 40:31.700
All of you.

40:31.700 --> 40:33.180
Put down your weapons.

40:33.180 --> 40:36.122
Surrender quietly.

40:44.860 --> 40:47.700
All right. Since you're on the case,

40:47.700 --> 40:49.740
it's inconvenient for me to be here.

40:49.740 --> 40:51.539
I'll take my leave.

40:51.539 --> 40:52.780
Commander Shao.

40:52.780 --> 40:54.579
You're running away already?

40:54.579 --> 40:56.619
You brought so many assassins
from the Tang Sect to silence them.

40:56.619 --> 40:58.260
And you want to escape unscathed?

40:58.260 --> 40:59.979
What do you mean by that?

40:59.979 --> 41:01.700
What does the Tang Sect have to do with me?

41:01.700 --> 41:03.059
You want to blame the Tang Sect?

41:03.059 --> 41:04.539
You should go to its leader.

41:04.539 --> 41:05.619
Why are you looking for me?

41:05.619 --> 41:07.340
I just received news

41:07.340 --> 41:09.459
that some bandits are causing trouble here.

41:09.459 --> 41:12.220
I'm here to settle the matter.

41:12.220 --> 41:14.180
Bai Yu Tang.

41:14.180 --> 41:16.139
Whether Shao Ji Zu is guilty or not,

41:16.139 --> 41:18.220
we'll know when we get the evidence.

41:18.220 --> 41:19.499
No need

41:19.499 --> 41:22.468
for haste.

41:29.900 --> 41:31.459
Since Commander Shao

41:31.459 --> 41:33.900
is not involved in the case,

41:33.900 --> 41:36.370
do as you please.

41:57.020 --> 41:58.340
Huo Ling Long.

41:58.340 --> 42:01.856
You'll regret getting involved in this mess.

42:10.939 --> 42:14.003
Brother Zhan, did I make it in time?

42:15.300 --> 42:19.128
Thank you for saving my life.

42:26.220 --> 42:29.132
Thank you for your help.

42:31.499 --> 42:32.740
Yue Hua.

42:32.740 --> 42:34.260
I'm going to arrest Jing Yi Ming now.

42:34.260 --> 42:35.939
I'm afraid he'll destroy the evidence.

42:35.939 --> 42:37.340
Why don't you come with us

42:37.340 --> 42:40.371
and witness his end?

42:46.979 --> 42:48.059
No.

42:48.059 --> 42:49.579
I have to go back to Hanshui Palace

42:49.579 --> 42:51.019
to report to Granny.

42:51.019 --> 42:53.042
Farewell.

43:03.980 --> 43:06.896
Yue Hua...
